  "Subscribe compiles and type-checks the subscription filter, caching a valid program. An invalid expression is rejected immediately with HTTP 400 invalid_argument. At publish time the cached program runs for each subscription against the message. A true result routes a copy to that subscription's backing queue; a false result creates no copy for that subscription.": "Subscribe 编译订阅过滤条件并进行类型检查，缓存有效程序。无效表达式立即被拒绝，返回 HTTP 400 invalid_argument。发布消息时，针对每个订阅执行已缓存的程序；结果为 true 时，将副本路由到该订阅的支撑队列（backing queue）；结果为 false 时，不为该订阅创建副本。",
